              <h3>Effective written communication</h3>
<p>Written communication has many similarities to verbal communication. However, where verbal or face to face communication use body and tone of voice to convey meaning, written communication relies on several other elements.</p>
<p>Let's have a look at the elements that effective written communication should contain.</p>

              <!-- sections.njk VIDEO! -->
              
              
              
      <div class="l-video-container">
        <video poster="~/images/svg/poster.svg" controls preload="metadata" aria-labelledby="watch" width="1000"
